#. module: odossey_purchase_pos_payment_check
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:odossey_purchase_pos_payment_check.field_l10n_latam_check__handed_to_partner_id
msgid ""
"Set when this third-party check was handed over to a supplier to settle a "
"purchase order, instead of being deposited or going through core's own "
"third-party-check-transfer flow (which requires the check to have first been"
" received through a real journal -- not the case for a check tracked via "
"l10n_latam_check_ext's instant, journal-less creation)."
msgstr ""
"Se establece cuando este cheque de terceros se entrega a un proveedor para "
"saldar una orden de compra, en lugar de depositarlo o de usar el "
"mecanismo formal de transferencia de cheques de terceros (que exige que el "
"cheque ya haya sido recibido a través de un diario real -- no es el caso "
"de un cheque registrado mediante la creación instantánea y sin diario de "
"l10n_latam_check_ext)."

